{
    "title": "Solitaire - 2024",
    "description": "\u2605Do you like playing Classic Solitaire, Klondike solitaire, Spider Solitaire, Tripeaks Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, Mahjong Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, and any Patience solitaire card game?\r\n\u2605Are you looking for a better classic solitaire card game to relax your mind and train your brain?\r\n\r\nSolitaire - 2024 by Standard Puzzle is very addicting and challenging. Our classic free solitaire card game with the unique gameplay of \u201cGarden\u201d is a good choice for relaxing and brain-storming!\r\n\r\n\"Solitaire\" typically refers to Klondike Solitaire. It\u2019s one of the most popular classic card games in the world, and the best-known solitaire card game in the US and Canada. Klondike Solitaire is also known as a Patience card game. People play the Klondike Solitaire card game as an exercise in patience. Klondike Solitaire is played with a standard 52-card deck, from Aces to Kings without Jokers.\r\n\r\nIn addition, we offer the unique gameplay -- \u201cGardens\u201d. Unlock gardens and collect sunshine by completing the solitaire puzzle, grow beautiful flowers, build and decorate your own gorgeous gardens and share with your friends!\r\n\r\nHow to play\r\n\u2660 To solve the Klondike deal, you need to tap, drag or drop to sort cards of 4 suits in ascending order, Ace 2, ... Jack, Queen, King.\r\n\u2660 You will have 7 card column options where you can move one card or consecutive cards from one column to another.\r\n\u2660 King or any consecutive cards starting with K can be moved to the empty columns.\r\n\u2660 Click the draw pile and find the card you want if you get stuck.\r\n\r\n\r\nHighlights\r\n\u2663 Unique gameplay -- \u201cGardens\u201d\r\n\u2663 Customizable themes, card faces, card backgrounds, wallpapers and table design.\r\n\u2663 Tons of colorful themes with great design: undersea, pets, seasons, moon, butterfly, horse, jellyfish, beautiful sceneries, cute animals, aquarium, waterfall, ocean fish and so on.\r\n\u2663 Multiple, changeable and artistic card faces: Fish, pets, birds, food, diamonds and so on.\r\n\u2663 Variety of beautiful card backgrounds: Birds, pets, flowers, plants, festivals, fruits and so on.\r\n\u2663 Fantastic and stunning game win animations\r\n\u2663 Level up, gain medals and show off to your friends\r\n\u2663 Unlimited random decks\r\n\u2663 Addictive, challenging and good brain training\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n\u2665 Draw 1 card or 3 cards\r\n\u2665 Winnable deck & Random deck\r\n\u2665 Daily challenges\r\n\u2665 Daily tasks: Keep you busy and train your brain\r\n\u2665 Unlimited free Hints and Undos\r\n\u2665 Useful tools: Hint, Undo, Magic Wand\r\n\u2665 Left-hand mode and right-hand mode available\r\n\u2665 Timer, moves & score\r\n\u2665 Statistics tracker: Record your game statistics, your best time of a deal, victories and the highest score\r\n\u2665 More than 150 solitaire deck backgrounds: The backgrounds make your solitaire game more beautiful and interesting, including beautiful scenery, cute animals, pretty flowers, live fish, birds, and so on.\r\n\u2665 More than 100 solitaire card backs\r\n\u2665 More than 10 solitaire card faces\r\n\u2665 Changeable and creative animations of victory\r\n\u2665 Customizable game theme, card faces and card backgrounds\r\n\u2665 Offline available: You can play it anytime, anywhere.\r\n\u2665 Auto-complete available\r\n\r\nCome and play this popular free classic solitaire card game in the world! Our Klondike Solitaire game will bring you lots of fun and challenges, and also train your brain!! You will be the next Klondike master!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2605Do you like playing Classic Solitaire, Klondike solitaire, Spider Solitaire, Tripeaks Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, Mahjong Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, and any Patience solitaire card game?<br>\u2605Are you looking for a better classic solitaire card game to relax your mind and train your brain?<br><br>Solitaire - 2024 by Standard Puzzle is very addicting and challenging. Our classic free solitaire card game with the unique gameplay of \u201cGarden\u201d is a good choice for relaxing and brain-storming!<br><br>&quot;Solitaire&quot; typically refers to Klondike Solitaire. It\u2019s one of the most popular classic card games in the world, and the best-known solitaire card game in the US and Canada. Klondike Solitaire is also known as a Patience card game. People play the Klondike Solitaire card game as an exercise in patience. Klondike Solitaire is played with a standard 52-card deck, from Aces to Kings without Jokers.<br><br>In addition, we offer the unique gameplay -- \u201cGardens\u201d. Unlock gardens and collect sunshine by completing the solitaire puzzle, grow beautiful flowers, build and decorate your own gorgeous gardens and share with your friends!<br><br>How to play<br>\u2660 To solve the Klondike deal, you need to tap, drag or drop to sort cards of 4 suits in ascending order, Ace 2, ... Jack, Queen, King.<br>\u2660 You will have 7 card column options where you can move one card or consecutive cards from one column to another.<br>\u2660 King or any consecutive cards starting with K can be moved to the empty columns.<br>\u2660 Click the draw pile and find the card you want if you get stuck.<br><br><br>Highlights<br>\u2663 Unique gameplay -- \u201cGardens\u201d<br>\u2663 Customizable themes, card faces, card backgrounds, wallpapers and table design.<br>\u2663 Tons of colorful themes with great design: undersea, pets, seasons, moon, butterfly, horse, jellyfish, beautiful sceneries, cute animals, aquarium, waterfall, ocean fish and so on.<br>\u2663 Multiple, changeable and artistic card faces: Fish, pets, birds, food, diamonds and so on.<br>\u2663 Variety of beautiful card backgrounds: Birds, pets, flowers, plants, festivals, fruits and so on.<br>\u2663 Fantastic and stunning game win animations<br>\u2663 Level up, gain medals and show off to your friends<br>\u2663 Unlimited random decks<br>\u2663 Addictive, challenging and good brain training<br><br>KEY FEATURES<br>\u2665 Draw 1 card or 3 cards<br>\u2665 Winnable deck &amp; Random deck<br>\u2665 Daily challenges<br>\u2665 Daily tasks: Keep you busy and train your brain<br>\u2665 Unlimited free Hints and Undos<br>\u2665 Useful tools: Hint, Undo, Magic Wand<br>\u2665 Left-hand mode and right-hand mode available<br>\u2665 Timer, moves &amp; score<br>\u2665 Statistics tracker: Record your game statistics, your best time of a deal, victories and the highest score<br>\u2665 More than 150 solitaire deck backgrounds: The backgrounds make your solitaire game more beautiful and interesting, including beautiful scenery, cute animals, pretty flowers, live fish, birds, and so on.<br>\u2665 More than 100 solitaire card backs<br>\u2665 More than 10 solitaire card faces<br>\u2665 Changeable and creative animations of victory<br>\u2665 Customizable game theme, card faces and card backgrounds<br>\u2665 Offline available: You can play it anytime, anywhere.<br>\u2665 Auto-complete available<br><br>Come and play this popular free classic solitaire card game in the world! Our Klondike Solitaire game will bring you lots of fun and challenges, and also train your brain!! You will be the next Klondike master!",
